kazakhstan","concept_label":"Situer le Kazakhstan","type":"map_pick","prompt":"Touche l''emplacement du Kazakhstan.","explanation":"Le Kazakhstan, 9e plus grand pays du monde, s''étend de la mer Caspienne à la Chine. Les autres points : Mongolie, Iran et Ukraine.","takeaway":"C''est le plus grand pays au monde sans accès à l''océan.","difficulty":58,"status":"published","payload":{"region":{"lat":42,"lon":68,"span":55},"options":[{"id":"13c3b03a","lat":48,"lon":67},{"id":"b9b53245","lat":46.9,"lon":103.8},{"id":"5a2b2d36","lat":32.4,"lon":53.7},{"id":"4a1facc3","lat":49,"lon":31}]},"answer":{"option_id":"13c3b03a"}},{"external_key":"geo-015","concept_id":"geography.countries.largest_area","concept_label":"Plus grand pays","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quel est le plus grand pays du monde par la superficie ?","explanation":"La Russie couvre environ 17 millions de km², près de deux fois le Canada, deuxième.","difficulty":18,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"7a20f237","text":"Russie"},{"id":"86427295","text":"Canada"},{"id":"7b67a31e","text":"Chine"},{"id":"ba046bd2","text":"États-Unis"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"7a20f237"}},{"external_key":"geo-016","concept_id":"geography.countries.most_populous","concept_label":"Pays le plus peuplé","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quel est le pays le plus peuplé du monde ?","explanation":"Selon les Nations unies, l''Inde a dépassé la Chine en 2023, avec plus de 1,4 milliard d''habitants.","source":"Nations unies, World Population Prospects","fact_as_of":"2023-04-24","difficulty":45,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"6beb4f97","text":"Inde"},{"id":"c11130fa","text":"Chine"},{"id":"37697074","text":"États-Unis"},{"id":"83ca9ec4","text":"Indonésie"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"6beb4f97"}},{"external_key":"geo-017","concept_id":"geography.borders.portugal_france","concept_label":"Portugal et France","type":"true_false","prompt":"Le Portugal a une frontière terrestre avec la France.","explanation":"Le Portugal n''a qu''un seul