nt Everest ?","explanation":"En 2020, la Chine et le Népal ont annoncé ensemble une mesure de 8 848,86 m.","takeaway":"L''Everest dépasse de peu les 8 800 m.","source":"Mesure conjointe Chine–Népal","fact_as_of":"2020-12-08","difficulty":50,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"a9e1e5e5","text":"8 849 m"},{"id":"d18cabc5","text":"7 546 m"},{"id":"2f55bba8","text":"9 312 m"},{"id":"bf515e0e","text":"8 091 m"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"a9e1e5e5"}},{"external_key":"geo-022","concept_id":"geography.relief.andes_longest","concept_label":"Les Andes","type":"true_false","prompt":"Les Andes sont la plus longue chaîne de montagnes continentale du monde.","explanation":"Les Andes s''étirent sur environ 7 000 km, du Venezuela à la Terre de Feu.","difficulty":45,"status":"published","payload":{},"answer":{"value":true}},{"external_key":"geo-023","concept_id":"geography.oceans.longest_french_river","concept_label":"Plus long fleuve de France","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quel est le plus long fleuve de France ?","explanation":"La Loire mesure environ 1 000 km, entièrement en France. Le Rhône prend sa source en Suisse.","difficulty":35,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"b2123d54","text":"La Loire"},{"id":"5043b833","text":"La Seine"},{"id":"c63009d5","text":"Le Rhône"},{"id":"20ce63da","text":"La Garonne"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"b2123d54"}},{"external_key":"geo-024","concept_id":"geography.oceans.largest_ocean","concept_label":"Plus grand océan","type":"mcq","prompt":"Quel est le plus vaste océan du monde ?","explanation":"Le Pacifique couvre environ un tiers de la surface de la Terre, plus que toutes les terres émergées réunies.","difficulty":18,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"e9911d86","text":"Pacifique"},{"id":"4ef02ee0","text":"Atlantique"},{"id":"c48545fe","text":"Indien"},{"id":"7d629da2","text":"Arctique"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"e9911d86"}},{"external_key":"geo-025","concept_id":"geography.oceans.rivers_length_order","concept_label":"Longueur des fleuves français","type":"ordering","prompt":"Classe ces fleuves du plus long au plus court (longueur totale).","explanation":"Loire ≈ 1 000 km, Rhône ≈ 810 km (dont une partie en Suisse), Seine ≈ 775 km, Garonne ≈ 530 km.","difficulty":60,"status":"published","payload":{"items":[{"id":"ceb61b85","text":"Loire"},{"id":"066fc0ba","text":"Rhône"},{"id":"761ce99f","text":"Seine"},{"id":"63c323e7","text":"Garonne"}]},"answer":{"order":["ceb61b85","066fc0ba","761ce99f","63c323e7"]}},{"external_key":"geo-026","concept_id":"geography.monuments.alhambra","concept_label":"L''Alhambra","type":"mcq","prompt":"Dans quelle ville se trouve l''Alhambra ?","explanation":"L''Alhambra, palais-forteresse des souverains nasrides, domine Grenade en Andalousie.","difficulty":45,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"85f2def0","text":"Grenade"},{"id":"d1a75bdc","text":"Séville"},{"id":"b6b7372a","text":"Cordoue"},{"id":"48489831","text":"Tolède"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"85f2def0"}},{"external_key":"geo-027","concept_id":"geography.monuments.machu_picchu","concept_label":"Machu Picchu","type":"mcq","prompt":"Dans quel pays se trouve le Machu Picchu ?","explanation":"Cette cité inca du XVe siècle est perchée à environ 2 400 m dans les Andes péruviennes.","difficulty":25,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"850044c9","text":"Pérou"},{"id":"c47a4176","text":"Bolivie"},{"id":"c19e8d04","text":"Mexique"},{"id":"5c0d9d0d","text":"Chili"}]},"answer":{"option_id":"850044c9"}},{"external_key":"geo-028","concept_id":"geography.monuments.angkor","concept_label":"Angkor Vat","type":"mcq","prompt":"Dans quel pays se trouve le temple d''Angkor Vat ?","explanation":"Angkor Vat, construit au XIIe siècle, figure même sur le drapeau du Cambodge.","difficulty":40,"status":"published","payload":{"options":[{"id":"6fa7e5af","text":"Cambodge"},{"id":"e7de0c31","text":"Thaïlande"},{"id":"dec243f1","text":"Viêt Nam"},{"id":"5560b726","text":"Laos"}]},"answer":{"option_id":